        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Aquí tienes una primera versión.\n\n**etl.py**\n```python\nimport csv\n\ndef medias(path):\n    with open(path) as f:\n        rows = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n    return {k: sum(float(r[k]) for r in rows) / len(rows) for k in rows[0]}\n```\n\nEjecuta `python etl.py`."
          ]
