        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "### Versión mejorada\n\n- Ignora celdas vacías\n- Añade CLI con argparse\n\n**etl.py**\n```python\nimport csv\nimport argparse\n\ndef medias(path):\n    with open(path) as f:\n        rows = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n    out = {}\n    for k in rows[0]:\n        vals = [float(r[k]) for r in rows if r[k].strip()]\n        out[k] = sum(vals) / len(vals) if vals else None\n    return out\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    p = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    p.add_argument(\"csv\")\n    print(medias(p.parse_args().csv))\n```"
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": true,
